  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your magic overtakes your body, blessing you with an advanced physiology as you sink deeper into depravity.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Addictive Casting drawback or Unsettling Casting drawback, Witchwarped, magic skill bonus 5.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Select one additional trait that you could select with the Witchwarped feat. While you possess a lesser madness or a moderate addiction as a result of a casting drawback, you gain the benefits of this trait in addition to the trait granted from Witchwarped.</p>\n<p>When your magic skill bonus reaches 10, you may select a third trait which you gain while you possess a greater madness or severe addiction</p>\n<p>Traits gained from this feat count towards the number of traits you may possess when under the effects of Blank Transformation, but are not considered a polymorph effect.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/drawback-feats#toc18\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
